BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Broadway in Brattleboro
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261108
DTSTAMP:20261107T165455Z
UID:a2f58e552b712c2b542da5857e25e9@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Broadway in Brattleboro is back for year two! Join us as we bu
 ild on last year’s success for an even livelier night of music and enter
 tainment! Broadway in Brattleboro features Broadway stars joined by homegr
 own talent for a uniquely Vermont experience. This one-night-only celebrat
 ion of the arts will highlight the gift of youth arts education\, the powe
 r of creativity\, and the endless possibilities for the future\; featuring
  stories and songs from Broadway performers\, as well as our very own New 
 England Youth Theatre mentors. Hosted by NEYT alum Taylor Ford Patno (On t
 he Horizon) with Nick Bombicino as Music Director\, this year’s growing 
 lineup includes professional dancer and choreographer Manwé Sauls-Addison
  (Michael Jackson\, Beyoncé\, Saturday Night Live\, Lip Sync Battle)\, Ch
 ristine Suddeth (TINA: The Tina Turner Musical\, Guys and Dolls)\, Bryan S
 ongy (A Christmas Carol\, Camp Morning Wood). Returning stars feature Hann
 ah Bonnett (Legally Blonde\, FIVE\, Dandelion)\, Alex Nicholson (Hamilton
 \, Moulin Rouge!)\, Amanda Wilson Maloof (As You Like It\, Much Ado About 
 Nothing\, The Taming of the Shrew\, 1776)\, and Cassidy Stoner (Aladdin\, 
 Titanique\, Little Shop of Horrors)\, with additional performers still to 
 be announced.\n\nSources: Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:New England Youth Theatre\, Brattleboro\, VT
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/broadway-i
 n-brattleboro-12-09-2026-08-38-41
END:VEVENT
