BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Joe Jencks Benefit Concert
DTSTART:20261107T190000
DTEND:20261107T210000
DTSTAMP:20261107T165455Z
UID:d970bae82cc2ead85909337d2ce4d6@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:It is fitting that the person who wrote "Lady of the Harbor" s
 hould sing a benefit concert for refugees and asylum seekers. So Joe Jenck
 s will perform Nov. 7 at 7 p.m. at All Souls Church to benefit CASP and th
 e ECDC. Jencks is a 25-year veteran of the international folk circuit\, an
  award-winning songwriter\, and celebrated vocalist based in Chicago\, IL
 \, but traveling the world over. November 7 will be the Saturday after the
  election when we all could use some song. Tickets are $25 and available o
 nline at http://www.ascvt.org/JoeJencks The Community Asylum Seekers Proje
 ct (CASP) is dedicated to welcoming and supporting asylum seekers in South
 ern Vermont\, ensuring they have access to safety\, stability\, and the re
 sources needed to rebuild their lives. ECDC VT provides essential resource
 s\, case management\, and community connections to help refugees find thei
 r footing and foster a lasting sense of belonging in their new rural homes
 . Merging conservatory training with his Irish roots and working-class upb
 ringing\, Joe delivers engaged musical narratives filled with heart\, soul
 \, groove\, and grit. Joe is noted for his unique merging of musical beaut
 y\, social consciousness\, and spiritual exploration. Blending well-crafte
 d instrumentals and vivid songwriting\, Joe Jencks serves it all up with a
  lyric baritone voice that has the edgy richness of a good sea-salt carame
 l. Having penned several #1 folk songs\, including the ever-relevant Lady 
 of The Harbor\, Joe has become a fan favorite throughout North America and
  is the co-founder of harmony trio\, Brother Sun. Joe also toured the Cari
 bbean with the U.S. State Department as a Cultural Ambassador.\n\nSources:
  Vermont Public
LOCATION:All Souls Church UU\, 29 South Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/joe-jencks
 -benefit-concert-21-10-2026-10-02-00
END:VEVENT
