DESCRIPTION:Renee Blacken will be at McIndoes Academy Community Center on 
 November 7th at 2pm to share her jaw dropping journey! New Hampshire adven
 turer Renee Blacken rowed 3\,200 miles solo across the Atlantic Ocean. Dis
 cover what inspired her to take on this extraordinary transatlantic journe
 y. “In March of this year\, I completed a solo transatlantic row (as Tea
 m fOARtysomething) in support of Outdoor Adventuring for Good to raise awa
 reness of and funding for trauma recovery programs in northern NH. If you 
 are on a journey with mental or physical health\, know you are not alone\,
  you matter\, you are seen.” All are welcome. Admission by donation. Adm
 ission by Donation\n\nSources: Vermont Public
