DTEND:20261107T150000
DTSTAMP:20261107T165455Z
UID:9c398c9cc49137b7fa57e4b6e096fb@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Join ECHO and Whale & Dolphin Conservation (WDC) for an immers
 ive learning experience all about the wonders of whales! Meet Delilah\, a 
 life-sized inflatable model of the endangered North Atlantic Right Whale. 
 Guests will learn about these incredible creatures and their connection to
  Lake Champlain\, explore hands-on activities\, and have a chance to ventu
 re inside Delilah for a special presentation with WDC educators. *Limited 
 space available. Tours inside Delilah will be available on a first-come\, 
 first-served basis.\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:ECHO\, Leahy Center for Lake Champlain\, 1 College St.
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/whale-of-a
 -day-at-echo-21-10-2026-16-18-26
